integration.inkscape.install_extensions_.translation:
Baadhi ya faili tayari zipo kwenye folda ya viendelezi vya InkSim. Faili zilizoorodheshwa kubadilishwa huenda zina mabadiliko yako. Faili nyingine zilizoorodheshwa zitahifadhiwa na hazitafutwa kamwe.

Faili za kubadilishwa:
{replace_files}

Faili za kuhifadhi:
{preserve_files}

Uendelee?

integration.inkscape.remove_old_extensio.source:
The listed user extension folders and all files inside them will be permanently deleted. The current install/update target and system extension folders will not be removed.

{directories}

Continue?

integration.inkscape.remove_old_extensio.translation:
Folda za viendelezi vya mtumiaji zilizoorodheshwa na faili zote zilizomo zitafutwa kabisa. Mahali pa sasa pa kusakinisha/kusasisha na folda za viendelezi vya mfumo hazitaondolewa.

{directories}

Uendelee?
